      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "希少な魚だけあって、なかなか面白い見た目を\nしていますね。長い胸びれが翼のようで、\n気品があり、まるで神の使いの如き優美さです。\nこれは神饌にふさわしい！　大変満足しました！",
        "official_en": "This fish has such a strange appearance. Its fins sit\nlike wings and there's such an aura of elegance here.\nIt feels less like a fish and more like a divine\nmessenger. A fitting offering! Thank you.",
